# dsv41: expose bounded per-request lane snapshots
#
# GET /lanes (API-key gated even with --metrics-open) reports queued, prefill and decode requests plus the latest
# 16 completed requests. The lane thread publishes only host-side state: fixed-capacity records and atomic counters;
# there are no GPU reads, GPU synchronizations, device allocations, extra RDMA/NCCL messages or per-token logs.
# DSV41 reports prompt progress at existing chunk boundaries as computed tokens after the restored cached prefix.
# HTTP serialization and its allocations stay on the HTTP thread.
#
# Applies after 0067-stream-single-call-heartbeat.patch on TF_REF fbbc97132cd004237d9887b8d3185896efaedc5c.

